  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      202.97,
      383.85,
      226.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CONSTITUTION OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      238.97,
      401.89,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Constitution of the Democrtic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka has guaranteed and assured to protectand foster the Buddha Sasana and the rights of all otherreligions:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.9,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS it has become a timely need to enact provisionsinto the Constitution for the purpose of maintenance andpreservation of religious dignity and holiness with a view toachieving of unity and concord of the Nation:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      358.97,
      401.9,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      394.97,
      401.87,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Nineteenth Amendmentto the Constitution.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      430.97,
      401.89,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "2. The Article 91 of the Constitution be amended byinserting the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      466.97,
      380.15,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c91(1) (d) (xiii) a priest of any religion\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      490.97,
      401.9,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "3.This amendment shall come into operation soon afterthe expiry or the dissolution of the seventh Parliament.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      526.97,
      401.9,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      396.31,
      444.58,
      405.38
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
